# REQUIREMENTS: cu-002

CU-002 implements RSS ingestion for geopolitics feeds, replacing the crawl4ai StreamScraper deep_crawl/chunk path with feed polling that yields RssItem lists via the canonical Rome `new SyndFeedInput().build(new XmlReader(stream))` call over a Java HttpClient fetch. Requires cu-001 (RssItem, RssSource). This CU satisfies feat-1 criterion 2 (all configured feeds pulled with guid/title/link/date/description; no website scraping on the Scala path).
